bound-lock/1 about="receipts.bound in a place is a region rendered at a resolution: @0 the root digest line, @1 one line per region (region, count, digest of its set), @8 every receipt; @1 ships, @8 stays in the root's CAS and travels as a release asset. A region's digest is over its canonical lines, sorted, attest lines excluded; the root digest is the digest of the region digests in region order. Verify's attest names the root digest in its at and stands in the root lock and the release, never inside the set it attests. cost/ship stays 0..1000, never widened; it is met when @1 lands" at=witness:a-set-that-attested-itself by=owner epoch=1 form=alphabet measure=resolution role=reads scope=audit/wire/receipts sig="ed25519:era1:kR4QVazV0t5kr7BHOcMrA7V/Gy0ampww1vsOH5GL6LewkfJQIanXLJvUw8y+8hzERIMRB9Jr0iPJB6vkt9YkDQ==" value=0|1|8
